{
  "title": "Lambda · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "이벤트에 따라 코드를 실행하는 서버리스 컴퓨팅이다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Lambda</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#function-runtime-and-handler\">Function, Runtime and Handler</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#synchronous-and-asynchronous-invocation\">Synchronous and Asynchronous Invocation</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#event-source-mapping\">Event Source Mapping</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#memory-timeout-and-concurrency\">Memory, Timeout and Concurrency</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#reserved-and-provisioned-concurrency\">Reserved and Provisioned Concurrency</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#execution-role-and-vpc-access\">Execution Role and VPC Access</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#versions-aliases-and-deployment\">Versions, Aliases and Deployment</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#snapstart-and-execution-reuse\">SnapStart and Execution Reuse</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#lambda-managed-instances\">Lambda Managed Instances</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#durable-functions\">Durable Functions</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>컴퓨팅</span><span>32 / 62</span></div><h1>Lambda</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 10 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Lambda는 Event나 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 요청에 따라 Function Code를 실행하는 관리형 Compute 서비스다. 기본 실행 모델에서는 서버 Provisioning을 직접 하지 않고 실행 시간·Memory 등에 따라 비용이 발생한다.</p><p>애플리케이션은 일시적인 Execution Environment에 영구 상태를 맡기지 않아야 한다. 현재 문서에는 Managed Instances와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#durable-functions\">Durable Functions</a> 같은 확장 모델도 있으므로 기본 Function의 제한을 모든 모델에 일괄 적용하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Event 전달과 실행\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Event 전달과 실행</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Direct invocation</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Caller / AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> event</strong><small>동기 또는 비동기 호출</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Lambda Function</strong><small>Execution Role로 작업</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Response / Destination</strong><small>호출 유형에 따라 결과 처리</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Event source mapping</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/\">Kinesis</a> / Streams</strong><small>보관된 Event</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Poll + Batch</strong><small>Source별 Retry·순서</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Lambda Function</strong><small>중복 처리에 안전하게 구현</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">기본 Function Timeout과 Managed Instances·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#durable-functions\">Durable Functions</a>의 실행 모델을 구분한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"function-runtime-and-handler\"><h2>Function, Runtime and Handler<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#function-runtime-and-handler\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Runtime이 Code를 실행하고 Handler가 Event를 처리한다. 지원 Language Runtime, Layer 또는 Container Image로 배포할 수 있다. Lambda Container Image를 사용해도 일반적인 장기 실행 Container Service가 되는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"synchronous-and-asynchronous-invocation\"><h2>Synchronous and Asynchronous Invocation<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#synchronous-and-asynchronous-invocation\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Synchronous 호출은 응답·오류를 Caller가 받으며 재시도 책임을 고려한다. Asynchronous 호출은 Lambda가 Event Queue와 재시도·Destination을 처리한다. 각 방식의 Retry·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a> 동작을 동일하게 가정하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"event-source-mapping\"><h2>Event Source Mapping<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#event-source-mapping\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/\">Kinesis</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#dynamodb-streams-and-ttl\">DynamoDB Streams</a> 등의 데이터 소스를 Poll하고 Batch로 Function에 전달한다. 실패 시 재처리 범위와 순서가 Source마다 다르다. 처리 중복 가능성을 고려해 Idempotent Handler를 만든다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"memory-timeout-and-concurrency\"><h2>Memory, Timeout and Concurrency<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#memory-timeout-and-concurrency\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Memory 설정은 CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span> 할당에도 영향을 준다. 기본 Function의 단일 실행 Timeout은 최대 15분이며 Concurrency는 동시에 실행되는 수다. Account Quota, Function 예약, Downstream DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Capacity를 함께 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"reserved-and-provisioned-concurrency\"><h2>Reserved and Provisioned Concurrency<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#reserved-and-provisioned-concurrency\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#reserved-and-provisioned-concurrency\">Reserved Concurrency</a>는 Function이 사용할 동시 실행 몫과 상한을 지정한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#reserved-and-provisioned-concurrency\">Provisioned Concurrency</a>는 미리 준비된 Environment로 초기 지연을 줄인다. 예약 동시성만 설정했다고 Cold Start가 사라지는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"execution-role-and-vpc-access\"><h2>Execution Role and VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> Access<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#execution-role-and-vpc-access\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Execution Role은 Function이 호출할 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 권한을 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> 연결은 Private DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 접근 등에 사용하며 인터넷 Outbound는 별도 경로가 필요하다. Function을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/#public-subnet\">Public Subnet</a>에 연결했다고 자동 Public IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>가 생기지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"versions-aliases-and-deployment\"><h2>Versions, Aliases and Deployment<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#versions-aliases-and-deployment\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Published Version은 Code·Configuration의 불변 버전이며 Alias는 버전을 가리킨다. Alias의 Traffic Weight와 배포 도구로 점진 전환할 수 있다. 환경변수에 비밀 값을 직접 넣는 것보다 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a> 등과 권한을 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"snapstart-and-execution-reuse\"><h2>SnapStart and Execution Reuse<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#snapstart-and-execution-reuse\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 Runtime의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#snapstart-and-execution-reuse\">SnapStart</a>는 초기화 상태 재사용으로 시작 지연을 줄인다. Execution Environment 재사용은 가능하지만 보장된 영구 저장이 아니다. Global 상태와 Temporary File은 재사용·동시성·보안 조건에 맞게 다룬다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"lambda-managed-instances\"><h2>Lambda Managed Instances<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#lambda-managed-instances\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> Compute에서 Function을 실행하면서 Lambda가 Instance 운영·패치·Scaling을 관리하는 별도 모델이다. 여러 요청을 동시에 처리할 수 있어 Thread Safety 등을 고려한다. 실행 시간·지원 Runtime·비용은 기본 Lambda와 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"durable-functions\"><h2>Durable Functions<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#durable-functions\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#reference-3\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 3\">[3]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#kinesis-client-library-and-checkpoints\">Checkpoint</a>와 재개를 통해 대기·장기 Workflow를 처리한다. 완료된 단계의 재생을 관리하지만 실패 전후 부수 효과는 Idempotency가 필요하다. 기본 Function 한 번의 15분 Timeout과 Durable Execution 전체 기간을 구별한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 이미지 업로드 후 변환을 실행할 때 기본 Lambda를 사용할 수 있다. 중복 Event에도 같은 결과가 나오게 하고 결과물은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>에 저장한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>상시 실행 또는 아주 긴 단일 작업에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>·컨테이너 등을 비교한다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/welcome.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">lambda/latest/dg/welcome.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-managed-instances.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">lambda/latest/dg/lambda-managed-instances.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/durable-configuration.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">lambda/latest/dg/durable-configuration.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q036/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q036\" data-question=\"Q036\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q036</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q036/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application runs an image transformation that takes a few seconds whenever a file is uploaded. Which option avoids managing servers directly?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q036\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Multi-AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q036\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Lambda</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q036\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An always-on dedicated EC2 instance only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q036\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a>는 이벤트 기반의 짧은 코드 실행에 알맞다. 실행 한도와 동시성을 점검한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q074\" data-question=\"Q074\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q074</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q074/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to filter EC2 instance state-change events and send matching events to Lambda using a Classic event bus and rules. Which service provides this capability?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q074\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q074\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q074\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront caching</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q074\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EventBridge</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">EventBridge</a> 규칙이 이벤트 패턴을 걸러 대상에 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">EventBridge</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q076\" data-question=\"Q076\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q076</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q076/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A workflow must explicitly handle branching, retries, and compensation across payment, inventory reservation, and shipment creation. Which service should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q076\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Step Functions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q076\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q076\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS gp3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q076\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">Step Functions</a>는 다단계 워크플로의 상태·분기·재시도를 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">Step Functions</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q077\" data-question=\"Q077\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q077</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q077/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A mobile application calls Lambda functions through an HTTPS API and needs authentication and request throttling. Which front-end service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q077\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q077\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q077\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon API Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q077\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a>는 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 인증·제한 등을 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q088\" data-question=\"Q088\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2,3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q088</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q088/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Lambda functions connect to a private RDS database. Which TWO services address connection spikes and secure storage of credentials?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Route 53 weighted record</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Secrets Manager</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Proxy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C, D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#rds-proxy\">RDS Proxy</a>는 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 연결을 풀링하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a>는 비밀 값을 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">이전 용어 <b>KMS</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">다음 용어 <b>NAT Gateway</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
